-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §28 פעילויות נוספות: the principal may impose
-- further activities that need presence in the school, within the
-- teacher's roles under the director-general's circular and beyond the
-- tasks of the stay hours; their hours come out of the work-meeting stay
-- hours of §§15(ד)(1), 17(ד)(1) and 18(ב)(1), reckoned monthly.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `28 פעילויות נוספות`

DECLARE `section 28 action` IS ONE OF `impose a further activity needing presence in the school`

@ref akn:art_28
GIVEN `within the roles the circular sets` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 28 action`
DECIDE `imposing further activities` `within the roles the circular sets` IS
    IF `within the roles the circular sets`
    THEN PARTY `the school principal` MAY `impose a further activity needing presence in the school`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- ¶2–¶3: the hours of the further activities come out of the work-meeting
-- stay hours, in a monthly reckoning: what is left of them for meetings is
-- the month's meeting hours less the activities' hours, never below none.
@ref akn:art_28/p2 akn:art_28/p3
GIVEN `meeting stay hours in the month` IS A NUMBER, `further-activity hours in the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `meeting stay hours left in the month` `meeting stay hours in the month` `further-activity hours in the month` IS
    max 0 (`meeting stay hours in the month` MINUS `further-activity hours in the month`)

-- What the clause does not say: what follows when the month's activities
-- outrun its meeting hours.
`further activities beyond the meeting hours, as a count` MEANS
    `meeting stay hours left in the month` 8 10
#ASSERT `further activities beyond the meeting hours, as a count` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `meeting stay hours left in the month` 8.66 3 EQUALS 5.66

#TRACE `imposing further activities` TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the school principal` DOES `impose a further activity needing presence in the school` AT 1
